              "answers": [
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>NO, This statement is incorrect, as warfarin is an anticogulant. Anticoagulants affect the clotting cascade. Platelets affect the platelet plug.</div>\n",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>Indeed, this statement is incorrect, as warfarin is an anticogulant. Anticoagulants affect the clotting cascade. Platelets affect the platelet plug.</div>\n",
                    "tip": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Despite being around longest, warfarin is still a valuable antiplatelet drug.&nbsp;</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>NO, this statement is incorrect. It can take some days for warfarin to become effective, as there is likely to be some vitamin K that is able to engage in the reactions that warfarin eventually affects.&nbsp;</div>\n",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>Indeed,&nbsp;this statement is incorrect. It can take some days for warfarin to become effective, as there is likely to be some vitamin K that is able to engage in the reactions that warfarin eventually affects.&nbsp;</div>\n",
                    "tip": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Warfarin initially becomes effective within 24 hours of the first dose.&nbsp;</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Warfarin is an enzymatic inhibitor of the enzyme epoxide reductase, which is involved in several clotting factors</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>The dose of warfarin is extremely variable between individuals</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Clients on warfarin need to be monitored frequently, with a measure called the INR.&nbsp;</div>\n"
                }
              ],
