              },
              "answers": [
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>NO, this statement is no longer correct. <strong>Rivaroxaban</strong> is an oral anticoagulant that has fewer side effects but a greater chance of GIT bleeding, and is a pregnancy category C drug that is used to treat deep vein thrombosis (DVT).</div>\n",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>Indeed, this statement is no longer correct. <strong>Rivaroxaban</strong> is an oral anticoagulant that has fewer side effects but a greater chance of GIT bleeding, and is a pregnancy category C drug that is used to treat deep vein thrombosis (DVT).</div>\n",
                    "tip": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Warfarin is the first line treatment as an anticoagulant.&nbsp;</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Clients on warfarin need to be monitored with frequent INRs&nbsp;</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>There is a large number of foods and drugs that are contraindicated during warfarin therapy.</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>NO, THIS STATEMENT IS INCORRECT. Warfarin should never be used even in women of child bbearing years, as it is a pregnancy category X drug.&nbsp;</div>\n",
                    "tip": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>Indeed, THIS STATEMENT IS INCORRECT. Warfarin should never be used even in women of child bbearing years, as it is a pregnancy category X drug.</div>\n"
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Warfarin is a pregnancy category X drug and as such should be used in pregnancy only when absolutely necessary.&nbsp;</div>\n"
                }
